<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Editar categoría | Admin</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/app.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/admin-utilities.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/admin.css">
</head>
<body class="admin-shell-body">
  <%- include("../../partials/admin-shell-start") %>
<main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-8">
    <div class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold text-stone-900">Editar categoría</h2>
      <p class="text-stone-600 mt-2">Actualiza la categoría de producto. Los géneros se manejan separados desde productos.</p>
    </div>

    <% if (error) { %>
      <div class="mb-6 rounded-xl bg-red-50 border border-red-200 text-red-700 px-4 py-3 text-sm">
        <%= error %>
      </div>
    <% } %>

    <form action="/admin/categories/<%= category._id %>/edit" method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data" class="bg-white border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm space-y-6">
      <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= adminCsrfToken %>">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div>
          <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-stone-700 mb-2">Nombre *</label>
          <input type="text" name="name" required value="<%= category.name %>" class="w-full rounded-xl border border-stone-300 px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-stone-800">
        </div>

        <div>
          <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-stone-700 mb-2">Slug</label>
          <input type="text" name="slug" value="<%= category.slug %>" class="w-full rounded-xl border border-stone-300 px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-stone-800">
        </div>

        <div>
          <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-stone-700 mb-2">Categoría padre</label>
          <select name="parentId" class="w-full rounded-xl border border-stone-300 px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-stone-800">
            <option value="">Sin padre</option>
            <% categories.forEach(item => { %>
              <% if (String(item._id) !== String(category._id)) { %>
                <option value="<%= item._id %>" <%= String(category.parentId || "") === String(item._id) ? "selected" : "" %>>
                  <%= item.name %>
                </option>
              <% } %>
            <% }) %>
          </select>
        </div>

        <div>
          <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-stone-700 mb-2">Orden</label>
          <input type="number" name="sortOrder" value="<%= category.sortOrder || 0 %>" class="w-full rounded-xl border border-stone-300 px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-stone-800">
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-stone-700 mb-2">Descripción</label>
        <textarea name="description" rows="4" class="w-full rounded-xl border border-stone-300 px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-stone-800"><%= category.description || "" %></textarea>
      </div>

      <div>
        <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-stone-700 mb-2">URL destino del cuadro</label>
        <input type="text" name="destinationUrl" value="<%= category.destinationUrl || '' %>" placeholder="Ej: /shop?category=anillos" class="w-full rounded-xl border border-stone-300 px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-stone-800">
        <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-2">Opcional. Si lo dejas vacío, la categoría enlaza automáticamente a /shop?category=slug.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3">
        <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-stone-700">Imagen de categoría</label>
        <input type="file" name="categoryImageFile" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp,image/gif" class="w-full rounded-xl border border-stone-300 px-4 py-3 bg-white">
        <input type="text" name="imageUrl" value="<%= category.imageUrl || "" %>" placeholder="O pega/conserva una URL existente" class="w-full rounded-xl border border-stone-300 px-4 py-3 outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-stone-800">
        <% if (category.imageUrl) { %>
          <div class="text-xs text-stone-500 break-all">Actual: <%= category.imageUrl %></div>
        <% } %>
        <p class="text-xs text-stone-500">Si subes una imagen, se usará esa imagen. Si no subes nada, se conserva la URL.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-emerald-100 bg-emerald-50 p-4">
        <label class="inline-flex items-start gap-3">
          <input type="checkbox" name="collectionFeatured" <%= category.collectionFeatured ? "checked" : "" %>>
          <span class="text-sm text-stone-700">
            <strong class="block text-stone-900">Mostrar en inicio como colección principal</strong>
            Marca solo las 4 categorías principales que deben verse en “Nuestras colecciones”. Ejemplo: Collares, Brazaletes, Anillos y Fragancias.
          </span>
        </label>
      </div>

      <label class="inline-flex items-center gap-3">
        <input type="checkbox" name="active" <%= category.active ? "checked" : "" %>>
        <span class="text-sm text-stone-700">Categoría activa</span>
      </label>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a href="/admin/categories" class="rounded-xl bg-white border border-stone-300 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-stone-50">
          Cancelar
        </a>
        <button type="submit" class="rounded-xl bg-stone-900 text-white px-5 py-3 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-stone-800">
          Guardar cambios
        </button>
      </div>
    </form>
  </main>
  <%- include("../../partials/admin-shell-end") %>
</body>
</html>
